on’s global timer name."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destinations he will walk into; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for anywhere."}]}],"name":"rooms"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Extra gate checked first — a false gate is a quiet turn."}]}],"name":"gate"},{"name":"arrivals","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lines printed when the companion catches up, if lit —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the turn counter; empty for a silent companion."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following daemon, for the host’s "},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"while:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are the two ways to scope a follower, and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scope different things. ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a whitelist of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"destinations"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" — a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"gaoler who walks the corridors and will not set foot in a cell follows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you along the one and lets you go into the other, which is what makes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“somewhere he will not go” a place you can stand. "},{"code":"while:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gate evaluated first, exactly as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:daemonName:rooms:chancePerTurn:while:arrival:departure:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is, for the companion who has been told to wait. Either left out is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always open, so a caller that passes neither behaves exactly as before."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that keeps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"type":"text","text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catches up the same turn and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"type":"text","text":" line trails the room"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}]},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the host may "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startDaemon(_:)"},{"text":" to resume.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steals"},{"text":"), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrivals"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"starts(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors":{"kind":"symbol","title":"GnustoActors","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","abstract":[{"text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TimedEvent":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TimedEvent"}],"title":"TimedEven